  "ruleText": "Ret 201.03 Mailing Address; Hearing Location. The mailing address for the filing of documents and the location, unless otherwise specified, for the conducting of adjudicative proceedings shall be:\n\nAdministrative Hearings\n\nNew Hampshire Retirement System\n\n80 Commercial Street\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03301-5031\n\nSource. #2980, eff 2-21-85, EXPIRED: 2-21-91\n\nNew. #5225, eff 9-18-91; ss by #5880, eff 8-19-94, EXPIRED: 8-19-00\n\nNew. #7374, INTERIM, eff 10-13-00, EXPIRES: 4-11-01; ss by #7477, eff 4-10-01; ss by #7572, eff 10-10-01; ss by #12709, eff 1-9-19",
